igh the communication concerns, which could potentially be mitigated with training.\n**Remaining uncertainty**:\n- How serious B\u2019s pretentiousness and tone issues are in real crew settings and whether they have led to concrete conflicts.\n- Whether D\u2019s moodiness and loner tendency might be less disruptive than anticipated, given his strong problem\u2011solving and responsibility.\n**What would change my vote**: If another agent provides strong positive evidence that D\u2019s interpersonal style does not impair crew cohesion, or concrete evidence that B\u2019s communication style has caused significant crew friction, I would reconsider and possibly shift to D or another candidate.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
